      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>aotContext</code> - never null.</dd>\n<dd><code>managedTypes</code> - never null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>new instance of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotContribution.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanRegistrationAotContribution</code></a> or null if nothing to do.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>aotContext</code> - 永不为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>managedTypes</code> - 永不为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aot/BeanRegistrationAotContribution.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aot\"><code>BeanRegistrationAotContribution</code></a> 的新实例，或者如果无需执行任何操作则返回 null。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a> to customize the <a href=\"../util/TypeCollector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>TypeCollector</code></a>, must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>4.0</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>Consumer</code></a>，用于自定义 <a href=\"../util/TypeCollector.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的类\"><code>TypeCollector</code></a>，该值不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>4.0</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>type</code> - the class to configure the contribution for.</dd>\n<dd><code>aotContext</code> - AOT context for type configuration.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>4.0</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>type</code> - 要为其配置贡献的类。</dd>\n<dd><code>aotContext</code> - 用于类型配置的 AOT 上下文。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>4.0</dd>",
